    <readme>README.md</readme>
    <projectUrl>https://github.com/borka-s/LibHeif.Native.Runtime</projectUrl>
    <description>Native libheif binaries for Windows (x64) and Linux (x64).
      Intended for use with LibHeifSharp. Provides libheif.dll / libheif.so
      in the correct runtimes/ layout so P/Invoke resolution works automatically.</description>
    <tags>libheif heif heic avif native image</tags>
